{
    "talkId": "6986404",
    "total_dialogue_lines": 32,
    "speaker_counts": {
        "Dog": 2,
        "Flins": 21,
        "Player": 9
    },
    "dialogues": [
        {
            "id": "698640401",
            "speaker": "Dog",
            "text": "Woof! Woof, woof!"
        },
        {
            "id": "698640402",
            "speaker": "Flins",
            "text": "Hahaha... This is a good one. Here, take this meat for yourself."
        },
        {
            "id": "698640403",
            "speaker": "Dog",
            "text": "Woof!",
            "choices": [
                {
                    "id": "698640404",
                    "text": "Is this your dog?",
                    "response": [
                        {
                            "id": "698640406",
                            "speaker": "Flins",
                            "text": "Mine? Not at all — it belongs to itself. It sometimes brings me old bones to help with my puzzles, that's all.",
                            "choices": [
                                {
                                    "id": "698640407",
                                    "text": "B—Bone puzzles?",
                                    "response": [
                                        {
                                            "id": "698640409",
                                            "speaker": "Flins",
                                            "text": "Ah, I should be clear — while I don't know what bones these are, I can say for certain they don't belong to any humans who slumber here or elsewhere."
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "698640410",
                                            "speaker": "Flins",
                                            "text": "Bones are another thing that tickles my fancy. Sometimes, when I see one that's a bit unusual, I'll pick it up and add it to my collection."
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "698640411",
                                            "speaker": "Flins",
                                            "text": "Then, when I'm feeling bored, I try to connect all my bones and create something whole, a bit like doing a jigsaw puzzle. You could call it a form of artistic expression."
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "698640412",
                                            "speaker": "Flins",
                                            "text": "Even though each piece of this \"Bone Puzzle Picture\" is unrelated to the next, and indeed they cannot possibly be related..."
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "698640413",
                                            "speaker": "Flins",
                                            "text": "Just pondering how best to put them together and create something beautiful is an extremely relaxing process."
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "698640414",
                                            "speaker": "Flins",
                                            "text": "Then one day, an uninvited guest intruded on the room where I kept my Bone Puzzle Picture — it was none other than the dog you saw just now.",
                                            "choices": [
                                                {
                                                    "id": "698640415",
                                                    "text": "Oh no!",
                                                    "response": [
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "698640417",
                                                            "speaker": "Flins",
                                                            "text": "It did! By the time I entered the room, the little intruder had completely dismantled my picture. The second it turned and saw me, it bolted away between my legs..."
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "698640418",
                                                            "speaker": "Player",
                                                            "text": "Such a shame..."
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "698640419",
                                                            "speaker": "Flins",
                                                            "text": "Luckily, all was not lost, as I'd already taken a photo of it. And more than that, now that my old puzzle was dismantled, I was free to construct an even bigger puzzle with my growing collection of bones."
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "698640420",
                                                            "speaker": "Flins",
                                                            "text": "Which is how I consoled myself at the time — after all, the damage had been done, so why not look on the bright side?"
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "698640421",
                                                            "speaker": "Flins",
                                                            "text": "The next day, as I was just about to begin piecing my puzzle together, my four-legged guest returned, and this time it brought a mouthful of bones."
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "698640422",
                                                            "speaker": "Flins",
                                                            "text": "I couldn't understand what it was saying, but its intent became clear when it laid its animal bones at my feet and then placed them one by one into my puzzle. After that, it simply sat down and looked at me."
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "698640423",
                                                            "speaker": "Flins",
                                                            "text": "After I gave it some cured meat, it got up and left."
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "698640424",
                                                            "speaker": "Flins",
                                                            "text": "Ever since then, it's dropped by from time to time to give me bones in exchange for food.",
                                                            "choices": [
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "698640425",
                                                                    "text": "It seems like the two of you have a budding relationship.",
                                                                    "response": [
                                                                        {
                                                                            "id": "698640427",
                                                                            "speaker": "Flins",
                                                                            "text": "Hmm, I think you might be viewing this with a little too much sentimentality — it's just a dog looking for food, nothing more."
                                                                        },
                                                                        {
                                                                            "id": "698640428",
                                                                            "speaker": "Flins",
                                                                            "text": "I'm a source of sustenance, and luckily for my canine friend, I happen to be relatively generous."
                                                                        },
                                                                        {
                                                                            "id": "698640429",
                                                                            "speaker": "Flins",
                                                                            "text": "Not that that's a bad thing. I view it more as an assistant under my employ."
                                                                        },
                                                                        {
                                                                            "id": "698640430",
                                                                            "speaker": "Flins",
                                                                            "text": "It doesn't speak, and it leaves when I tell it to — that's pretty much everything you could hope for in an assistant."
                                                                        },
                                                                        {
                                                                            "id": "698640431",
                                                                            "speaker": "Flins",
                                                                            "text": "If you'd like, you can give it some meat. Sometimes it sits and waits by your side, which I think probably means it's still hungry."
                                                                        },
                                                                        {
                                                                            "id": "698640432",
                                                                            "speaker": "Flins",
                                                                            "text": "Perhaps it might be a little more friendly with someone such as yourself."
                                                                        }
                                                                    ]
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "698640426",
                                                                    "text": "Does it ever try to play with you?"
                                                                }
                                                            ]
                                                        }
                                                    ]
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "698640416",
                                                    "text": "Please say it didn't..."
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        }
                                    ]
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "698640408",
                                    "text": "Y—You..."
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "id": "698640405",
                    "text": "It's very cute."
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}